{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f52ee7af03674ab0ae2d9cc73052c8d90ce1e6902b13b2511fbbda51494ba508", "ja": "（さて、昼休みまでにもうひと仕事だ。\nこのみさんの活動方針を考えないとな……）", "zh": "（那么，在午休前还得再忙一阵子。\n得考虑一下这次的活动方针了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "1e749b77618ac49c387360df335c95a4cff6259bb2fb3b939637c16d4742884b", "ja": "いたっ！　いたたたたっ！！", "zh": "好痛！好痛痛痛痛！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7584c9d8527836f83a995af853b753f2359c52fb48080f7902d5a8513ba959ab", "ja": "この声は、このみさん？\nでもレッスンは午後からじゃなかったかな？", "zh": "这个声音是此乃美小姐？\n不过，训练不是从下午开始吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "53ea94f9ec8da83c42859aeea359646e819924b64ac53e755eb79f7a151ee4d5", "ja": "お疲れ様です。やっぱりこのみさんでしたか！\nなんだか悲鳴が聞こえてましたけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了。果然是你，美奈子小姐！\n我刚才好像听到了悲鸣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "423b93569a788e7b794b96db923e1e185a45996fab4f336fafbb7b6d2635399d", "ja": "お疲れ様、{$P$}！\nちょっとね、体力づくりをしようかなと思って。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n我就是想着，要不要稍微锻炼一下体力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "d06a6f972634ce84170f1ad3e18855ec2bdbc166d93a6c3292d722505ed707e5", "ja": "この前、初めて公演に出たじゃない？　でもスタミナ\n切れで、ラストは思ったように動けなかったのよね。", "zh": "上次不是第一次参加演出嘛？可是因为体力耗尽，最后没能像自己想的那样行动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5501f1e73b39ac9e14210cc2c41bc25fb99325abf6bda62ffb7e2e3d1760cd3d", "ja": "そうでしたか。まあ、体は少しずつ鍛えて\nいきましょう。ちなみに、他に悩みはありますか？", "zh": "这样啊。总之，身体还是慢慢锻炼吧。顺便问一下，还有其他烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "72f334fc9a309d937d6ff3a947b3d612fa9a33e29f1e9e8bbe321cf5070a2e69", "ja": "えっ、悩み？　うーん……今は大丈夫だと思うわ。\nとにかく毎日が新鮮で、すごく楽しいもの！", "zh": "咦，烦恼？嗯……我觉得现在没什么问题。\n总之，每天都很新鲜，特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "1132d0232d87e0aa79b2a74d6f285631d518b9b22013ee484ef0e341daadc8d9", "ja": "もしかしたら、周りの若い子たちに\n影響されちゃってるのかもしれないけど。", "zh": "或许是受身边那些年轻孩子的影响了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "f396a28756882d9c9b2d31cb888578786bb3c0e3e038c811b9b1702f6e8eba13", "ja": "……でも、いいわよね？\n大人になってから、夢を見ても。", "zh": "……不过，也没什么不好的吧？\n就算长大成人了，也一样可以追寻梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d7beeb6d8b3bc4ea0bb918dc9b3b71d3230a25752a1c96f322a20da12d25646d", "ja": "……もちろんです。\n夢を見るのに、年齢は関係ないと思いますよ。", "zh": "……当然可以。\n我觉得追寻梦想和年龄并没有关系哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "49b1b0ca32f12aeaa0c16f54bd85466afd0297552889bad81da74ef1cc7a8f08", "ja": "フフッ、ありがと♪\nそういってもらえると心強いわ。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你♪\n听你这么说，我就放心多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ae0d966a684f8f7d552b048a5d461f1ff0a611dec52c0b7eca799b75020e40a3", "ja": "それに、そんな無謀な夢でもないと思いますし。\nこのみさんにはアイドルとしての才能がありますから。", "zh": "而且，我觉得那也不是什么鲁莽的梦想。\n因为这位小此木小姐有成为偶像的才能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "1310bdbc9d331b4326cce1706f2a7fd19b985b5bd66c8de30c32975af9ae4bc3", "ja": "そうなの？　でも、確かにやってみて思ったけど……\n意外と私、アイドルが向いてたのかもしれないわね！", "zh": "是这样吗？不过，我试过之后确实觉得……\n说不定我还挺适合当偶像的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "e76cc247accfb1897bdfdb7eef9dcd285791c78d9e8d2969e7ce38de520bdeb8", "ja": "歌はうまいって、カラオケでもよくほめられたし♪\nもちろんアイドルとしては、大人すぎると思うけど……", "zh": "唱歌好听这点，我在卡拉OK也经常被夸呢♪\n当然，作为偶像来说，我觉得自己年纪太大了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "a6a778b22eb89776a71d0e5612d02034e37e083766427d5658794c4755dd7e4c", "ja": "その分、アダルティな魅力では負けないもの。ウフッ♪", "zh": "在成熟魅力方面，我可不会输哦。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a094ce2bd0885b7a9da27e572e9cc7674550d6111c8d14526ade920066154d72", "ja": "そうですね……。ちなみに子供のころ、アイドルに\nなろう、なんて思ったことはなかったんですか？", "zh": "是啊……顺便问一下，您小时候有没有想过要成为偶像之类的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "b78445d7c2b7cfe6d0c5b3cbf879d038ca1e520f6799c93d4e8243b037b36192", "ja": "うーん、どうかしら？　普通に憧れてはいたけど……\n正直、進路として真剣に考えたことは、なかったわね。", "zh": "嗯……怎么说呢？我确实憧憬过偶像，不过……\n说实话，还从没认真考虑过把偶像当成未来的道路呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "da3b06d103a400c4c31231f8e336fb6bc92aece28715b7462e46de639e08708b", "ja": "私、こう見えてけっこう堅実なのよ。一応長女だし、\nいつの間にかブレーキを踏んじゃうっていうか。", "zh": "我这个人，看起来虽然不像，其实挺脚踏实地的。毕竟是长女嘛，\n不知不觉就会给自己踩刹车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "1c82a420165942dec1b988fe406764aea3584393a59665a3d853348fa2958461", "ja": "だから「アイドルになる！」って宣言したら、親よりも\n妹とか友達がビックリして、最初は心配されちゃった。", "zh": "所以我一宣布“我要成为偶像！”，妹妹和朋友们反而比父母更吃惊，起初还担心起我来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a731525c038d7f73dbe98ffded9387bafe723aa67522b8e6a3d9285e18ece6cd", "ja": "まあ、安定した職業ではないですからね。", "zh": "毕竟这不是个稳定的职业啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "7405c69b6b460099efcd266982cf85acb1292fe9e0c0833635e46d642553e7e3", "ja": "「騙されてない？」とか「年を間違われてない？」とか\n「保護者役はいる？」とか……失礼しちゃうわよね！", "zh": "“没被骗吧？”“是不是把年龄搞错了？”\n“需要监护人陪同吗？”什么的……真是太失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8a6da6e4fad0219cd94a37ebfc2b6cdfbcb5502f3eef7406c4bbed4fc66f8bc9", "ja": "（このみさん、周りからも愛されてるんだな……）", "zh": "（琴叶小姐也很受身边的人喜爱啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "b816fc2c6605d450fdec5295c695f760e92c3a353bbe2e8947c42ff985ab80da", "ja": "でも、最後にはみんな応援してくれたわ。「すごい、\nがんばって」って……。そういうの、嬉しかったわ。", "zh": "不过，最后大家都为我加油了。“好厉害，加油啊”……听到这些，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab99885778c48dfb93fe77e30367e7185283e42c7ce89ac8581b4743ab799842", "ja": "それに、私自身も同じ気持ちなのかも。\nアイドルって、本当にすごい子達だって思うもの。", "zh": "而且，我自己或许也是同样的心情吧。\n因为我觉得，偶像们真的是一群很了不起的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3862e80965014150172a28e4aac248a802eda04b633fc077d8b9f46b67931f7", "ja": "だから、そんなアイドルに挑戦してる今の自分も、\nすごいっていうか……けっこう気に入ってるのよね♪", "zh": "所以，我也在挑战成为那样的偶像，现在的自己该说是很厉害吧……其实还挺喜欢的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1026_p", "source_sha256": "598a11ee41551837195f864fc50ec9c59ddf9a243cb74e6b65541b2c90cd1aa2", "ja": "俺も今のこのみさん、すごくカッコいいと思います。\nこれからもしっかり背中を押していきますよ！", "zh": "我也觉得现在的这位木实小姐特别帅气。\n今后我也会坚定地支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "861e2dbdd526f1a45dbba71bc0bc69496d2620288fd26a82a4b020728e9553e2", "ja": "ありがとう！　頼りにしてるわね♪\nそれじゃ、早速お願いできるかしら？", "zh": "谢谢你！我很看好你哦♪\n那么，现在能马上拜托你一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d8c46287ad9609b7b1cebd672f91f567099207998e4c3874a7abaa91fc13bfab", "ja": "……え？　というと？", "zh": "……诶？是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "4a8dab5edd1d35e12c059770f22950f75e5fcedc6de70334ff5c2b061eb98c19", "ja": "私の背中を押してちょうだい！\n柔軟してたんだけど、体がぜんぜん曲がらなくて……。", "zh": "帮我按按背吧！我刚才在做拉伸，可身体完全弯不下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1030_p", "source_sha256": "035832f40a94d5c5e0090445bc6176f982c4d0f58fc39583f851aa9fbc55b991", "ja": "な、なるほど、わかりました！\nそれじゃ、早速……！", "zh": "原、原来如此，我明白了！\n那就马上开始……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "4886a7287057554f7528d30726c7ece630da23884bec11fca3da142f14f990e4", "ja": "いたたたっ！？　ちょ、{$P$}、\n押しすぎ……いたたたたたたたたっ！！", "zh": "好痛痛痛！？等、{$P$}，\n推得太用力了……好痛痛痛痛痛痛痛！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_039kon_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_039kon_004_1032_p", "source_sha256": "2e318918aa7185c86b5cf7197fc13537c5af624c8a0d5c78f58396995b889abf", "ja": "（小さな背中の奥の、大きな夢に向かって……。\nこれからも、しっかりと押していこう！）", "zh": "（朝着那娇小背影深处的伟大梦想……\n今后也要好好推着她前进！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
